{"posts":[{"id":"quasimodo_p14_326","t":"Good job, now it only has to break the main suppot level at around 4310 to fall deep.","a":"Infest","d":"","n":"#326","p":14,"im":[],"m":326},{"id":"quasimodo_p14_327","t":"Infest wrote: im watching AUD USD for a Quasimodo reversal move where ive marked in the chart\n\nThe quasimodo worked out really well. If taken to the next demand level (below LL), it's a great 3:1 opportunity with 60 pips gain by just risking 20 pips or less, depending on the entry.","a":"Infest","d":"","n":"#327","p":14,"im":["73733b8c0cd0d4e19679d1376256b0172691a384","8ea3b9b0cfbe8520fbdfaee66f56afcd07e59efc"],"m":327},{"id":"quasimodo_p14_328","t":"Some QM homework. Critiques welcome.","a":"Alientrader","d":"","n":"#328","p":14,"im":["5f606e4e30adfcb4ee9f871e95ad9b9166ffa55e"],"m":328},{"id":"quasimodo_p14_329","t":"QM X 2.","a":"Alientrader","d":"","n":"#329","p":14,"im":["11e19c7f5a955a61842cf8d6303a9ba89d5b4286"],"m":329},{"id":"quasimodo_p14_330","t":"","a":"Alientrader","d":"","n":"#330","p":14,"im":["7d6fa41f6afdf894894a869d7bb801a9c2b63244"],"m":330},{"id":"quasimodo_p14_331","t":"benhur wrote: You may note the long term memory level has....","a":"benhur","d":"","n":"#331","p":14,"im":["61d22a5baa6b9d9ded6dfeda96b865f94022748b","0dbaf81cc4a6a918780978e1dd9d31f9063c0eb5"],"m":331},{"id":"quasimodo_p14_332","t":"Alientrader wrote: QM X 2.\n\nThanks alien for perfect examples. Just wanna ask - I marked the red area where I would be looking for entry. Is that the right place? Obviously, price turned way below the rectangle, so I would let it go. Would YOU enter on this? Thanks.","a":"Carousel","d":"","n":"#332","p":14,"im":["11e19c7f5a955a61842cf8d6303a9ba89d5b4286","420674f4b3746d93d2d6ee8457ae05fcd67af3d1"],"m":332},{"id":"quasimodo_p14_333","t":"Thanks Carousel. It's easy in hindsight to say \"yes I would have entered\" but I cannot say that. What's important is to study many of these formations and decide for yourself where possible entry points exist. QMs seem to provide a few entry opportunities such as decision points, new supply or demand, etc.","a":"Alientrader","d":"","n":"#333","p":14,"im":[],"m":333},{"id":"quasimodo_p14_334","t":"Hi Everyone,:) Please feel free to make comments Thank you:)","a":"Pete44","d":"","n":"#334","p":14,"im":["05708574b90d18b3d724f81408075e66129b1667","685a44f88c40bced8af4c556ecbe09e7f3b30c67","30cab8857f3e75ad8addf42fc55560f4eaaa22f4","63f606954db2c898bcc625d64591773f234f6c1b","675e22472598c03689655ab6995fc9ef931daeb9","2bdaf24e5223022a1242e4b083135bde62057e30","1a0630c7506d1ffe993532f7f63ca509fcbbadd2","e08d9b3dfe65e703e64612949649bef92333ef50","9173dcc393a44850c9f69b4999af8946b59f1017"],"m":334},{"id":"quasimodo_p14_335","t":"Sorry there are few more Thank you","a":"Pete44","d":"","n":"#335","p":14,"im":["add488318b801a73ae8ba655003d367b933305a8","e5c9d37554ccaed64cb6df35d0d254608ac575c2"],"m":335},{"id":"quasimodo_p14_336","t":"Pete\n\nOn one of your charts (Please press the insert button, BTW, I hate having to edit images in!) you brought up something important\n\nQMs need not be to the pip. Keep in mind the rules of reading the marketat all times\n\nIf price initially turned before Supply or Demand, price can often break it, attracted to the true zone","a":"Ifmyante","d":"","n":"#336","p":14,"im":["ccfa65c32c0a0e6e871b6ac5a1d8987ae191cfad"],"m":336},{"id":"quasimodo_p14_337","t":"Thank you If for your feedback Sorry I didn't know about INSERT next time I'll do it Best Regards, Pete","a":"Pete44","d":"","n":"#337","p":14,"im":[],"m":337},{"id":"quasimodo_p14_338","t":"Accidental double post. Admin please delete if you want.","a":"bennygill","d":"","n":"#338","p":14,"im":[],"m":338},{"id":"quasimodo_p14_339","t":"Alrighty then... Quasimodo time!\n\nOut of curiosity why is it named Quasimodo?\n\nHere's first of many charts. Please feel free to correct any mistakes:)\n\nTechnically the LH did not reach the top of the H wicks. Does that make it invalid?? It hit some supply instead and dropped.... but was very close.\n\nEUR/USD M30\n\nEUR/USD Daily","a":"bennygill","d":"","n":"#339","p":14,"im":["d4ced663fe2095b00f28bcc738571958b2cbfaa4","a536b648910c162900ecc9cdd4b98a87b43c6c19"],"m":339},{"id":"quasimodo_p14_340","t":"Another QM.\n\nIt forms at local supply (not HTF supply) so not sure if this is within the rules??\n\nAgain the drop from HH made some fresh supply, and price reacted off this for the final leg down. Might keep an eye on that to see if it's a recurring theme.\n\nEUR/USD H1\n\nEUR/USD H4","a":"bennygill","d":"","n":"#340","p":14,"im":["84104e90d7427073b5fee3900906291630279ae3","cee2681be7965bc05de2347af99a6002496da514"],"m":340},{"id":"quasimodo_p14_341","t":"bennygill wrote: Out of curiosity why is it named Quasimodo?\n\ni think you can answer that yourself easy if you google it. i'd say in relation to its skewed shoulders level.\n\nbennygill wrote: Technically the LH did not reach the top of the H wicks. Does that make it invalid?? It hit some supply instead and dropped.... but was very close.\n\nyes its valid, sometimes it goes to level, sometimes even higher than the previous H. i prefer it as in your picture but the rest are valid also.","a":"Harry","d":"","n":"#341","p":14,"im":[],"m":341},{"id":"quasimodo_p14_342","t":"Benygill, I would say you have identified inner quasimodo (iQM) in your latest post. Look at this Infest's post:\n\nwww.readthemarket.com/index.php/forum/jo...vests?start=25#17462\n\nLP","a":"Les_Paul","d":"","n":"#342","p":14,"im":[],"m":342},{"id":"quasimodo_p14_343","t":"Harry wrote:\n\nbennygill wrote: Out of curiosity why is it named Quasimodo?\n\nbennygill wrote: Technically the LH did not reach the top of the H wicks. Does that make it invalid?? It hit some supply instead and dropped.... but was very close.\n\nThanks for clearing that up.\n\nLes_Paul wrote: Benygill, I would say you have identified inner quasimodo (iQM) in your latest post. Look at this Infest's post:\n\nwww.readthemarket.com/index.php/forum/jo...vests?start=25#17462\n\nLP\n\nHmmm interesting. I'll have to keep an eye out for those too!","a":"bennygill","d":"","n":"#343","p":14,"im":[],"m":343},{"id":"quasimodo_p14_344","t":"A failed QM. Well semi-failed... there was some pips to be made, but it didn't break the LL as per usual.\n\nLooking purely at the M30 I would have said the LH did not reach H. But on the H1 timeframe - where supply was identified - it looks like a valid QM. So not sure why it failed.\n\nNothing works 100% of the time, so maybe this is just one of those times it fails. If someone can spot a reason why please do share.\n\nEUR/USD M30\n\nEUR/USD H1","a":"bennygill","d":"","n":"#344","p":14,"im":["93953c6e5545db98696fcafa5979ba2940eec92b","92999685ca4eff3ec838846f7b6470d9365f19b5"],"m":344},{"id":"quasimodo_p14_345","t":"My thoughts on that:\n\nWe did have a QM trade there which worked out perfectly - just not exactly where you drew it","a":"Ifmyante","d":"","n":"#345","p":14,"im":["b93d465b01248ca4fa48c1f1e4ee77c7abaf5c08"],"m":345},{"id":"quasimodo_p14_346","t":"Ah! Great Just needed some well trained eyes.\n\nBeing new to RTM I'm not versed in all the abbreviations (yet). I assume FTR stands for \"first time return\" for the supply?","a":"bennygill","d":"","n":"#346","p":14,"im":[],"m":346},{"id":"quasimodo_p14_347","t":"Nope\n\nYou're thinking FTB - First time back\n\nFTR is Failure To Return - it's where a level gets broken, and price tries to get back in but fails. This marks the edge of a PAZ\n\nSee Wolverine's and CapnP's journals for the Hook - It's well documented by them","a":"Ifmyante","d":"","n":"#347","p":14,"im":[],"m":347},{"id":"quasimodo_p14_348","t":"Am I seeing this right?","a":"tradingjedi","d":"","n":"#348","p":14,"im":["fcc2063644eb3abeb939c9292be2acd28a43ae6c","7eccddb5e7e94d1c40ba34c16a67020dcfe2b462"],"m":348},{"id":"quasimodo_p14_349","t":"The proof of the pudding's in the eating","a":"Ifmyante","d":"","n":"#349","p":14,"im":["3b668b654b9dde065b5897e8038e373066331227"],"m":349},{"id":"quasimodo_p14_350","t":"Ifmyante wrote: The proof of the pudding's in the eating\n\nLol..Indeed it is my friend..Indeed it is!\n\n1011121314151617","a":"tradingjedi","d":"","n":"#350","p":14,"im":[],"m":350}],"images":[{"k":"73733b8c0cd0d4e19679d1376256b0172691a384","t":"assets/thumbs/73733b8c0cd0d4e19679d1376256b0172691a384.webp","f":"assets/images/73733b8c0cd0d4e19679d1376256b0172691a384.png","w":1076,"h":702,"b":22578,"o":"73733b8c0cd0d4e19679d1376256b0172691a384.png","p":14,"pid":"quasimodo_p14_327"},{"k":"8ea3b9b0cfbe8520fbdfaee66f56afcd07e59efc","t":"assets/thumbs/8ea3b9b0cfbe8520fbdfaee66f56afcd07e59efc.webp","f":"assets/images/8ea3b9b0cfbe8520fbdfaee66f56afcd07e59efc.png","w":1076,"h":702,"b":26956,"o":"8ea3b9b0cfbe8520fbdfaee66f56afcd07e59efc.png","p":14,"pid":"quasimodo_p14_327"},{"k":"5f606e4e30adfcb4ee9f871e95ad9b9166ffa55e","t":"assets/thumbs/5f606e4e30adfcb4ee9f871e95ad9b9166ffa55e.webp","f":"assets/images/5f606e4e30adfcb4ee9f871e95ad9b9166ffa55e.png","w":1200,"h":800,"b":25313,"o":"5f606e4e30adfcb4ee9f871e95ad9b9166ffa55e.png","p":14,"pid":"quasimodo_p14_328"},{"k":"11e19c7f5a955a61842cf8d6303a9ba89d5b4286","t":"assets/thumbs/11e19c7f5a955a61842cf8d6303a9ba89d5b4286.webp","f":"assets/images/11e19c7f5a955a61842cf8d6303a9ba89d5b4286.png","w":1200,"h":800,"b":29800,"o":"11e19c7f5a955a61842cf8d6303a9ba89d5b4286.png","p":14,"pid":"quasimodo_p14_332"},{"k":"7d6fa41f6afdf894894a869d7bb801a9c2b63244","t":"assets/thumbs/7d6fa41f6afdf894894a869d7bb801a9c2b63244.webp","f":"assets/images/7d6fa41f6afdf894894a869d7bb801a9c2b63244.png","w":1200,"h":800,"b":26715,"o":"7d6fa41f6afdf894894a869d7bb801a9c2b63244.png","p":14,"pid":"quasimodo_p14_330"},{"k":"61d22a5baa6b9d9ded6dfeda96b865f94022748b","t":"assets/thumbs/61d22a5baa6b9d9ded6dfeda96b865f94022748b.webp","f":"assets/images/61d22a5baa6b9d9ded6dfeda96b865f94022748b.png","w":1209,"h":802,"b":30163,"o":"61d22a5baa6b9d9ded6dfeda96b865f94022748b.png","p":14,"pid":"quasimodo